@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/AdditiveCombinatorics/57.lean
@decl Green57.Φ
-- L4DEL: title: The space `Φ(G)` of "convex combinations" of kernels from `baseΦ`
-- L4DEL: intuition: The space `Φ(G)` of "convex combinations" of kernels from `baseΦ`. Since `baseΦ G` is balanced (closed under multiplication by unit complex numbers) and contains 0, the absolutely convex hull over ℂ (i.e., the set of $\sum c_i \phi_i$ with $\phi_i \in \text{baseΦ}$ and $\sum |c_i| \le 1$) coincides with the real convex hull.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

