@file APNOutputs/AICollaborator/Graphs/GraphConjecture2.lean
@decl WrittenOnTheWallII.GraphConjecture2.conjecture2
-- L4DEL: title: WOWII Conjecture 2 For a simple connected graph `G`, `Ls(G) ≥ 2 · (l(G) - 1)` where `l(G)` is the average independence number of the neighbourhoods of the vertices of `G`
