@decl MonochromaticQuantumGraph.pmSumListAux
-- L4DEL: title: Auxiliary perfect-matching sum on a vertex list, using a fuel parameter `n` for termination
-- L4DEL: intuition: Auxiliary perfect-matching sum on a vertex list, using a fuel parameter `n` for termination. When called as `pmSumListAux W ι L.length L`, this computes the weighted sum over all perfect matchings on the vertices in `L`. The recursion pairs the head vertex with each later vertex and recurses on the remaining vertices. For lists of odd length, there are no perfect matchings and the value is `0`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

