-- L4DEL: intuition: The **van der Waerden number**, is the smallest integer `N` such that any `r`-coloring of `{1, ..., N}` is guaranteed to contain a monochromatic arithmetic progression of length `k`. It is defined as the infimum of the (non-empty) set of all such numbers `N`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

