@file APNOutputs/OEIS/a325046_odd_terms_at_k_times_k_plus_1.lean
@decl a
-- L4DEL: title: A325046: G.f.: $\sum_{n \ge 0} x^n \cdot \frac{(1 + x^n)^n}{(1 - x^{n+1})^{n+1}}$
-- L4DEL: intuition: A325046: G.f.: $\sum_{n \ge 0} x^n \cdot \frac{(1 + x^n)^n}{(1 - x^{n+1})^{n+1}}$. The term $a(N)$ is the coefficient of $x^N$ in the generating function. Expanding the terms, we get a formula for $a(N)$: $$a(N) = \sum_{n=0}^N \sum_{k=0}^n \mathbf{1}_{n + nk + (n+1)j = N} \binom{n}{k} \binom{n+j}{j}$$ where $j = \frac{N - n(k+1)}{n+1}$.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

