-- L4DEL: intuition: Number of maximal contiguous sublists of divisors of n where each adjacent pair (d_k, d_{k+1}) satisfies d_{k+1} <= 2 * d_k. This is 1 + the number of "jumps" where d_{k+1} > 2 * d_k.
